{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09759","headline":"醴泉东谿送程皓元镜微入蜀 · 岑参","name":"醴泉东谿送程皓元镜微入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀郡路漫漫，梁州过七盘。\n二人来信宿，一县醉衣冠。\n谿逼春衫冷，林交宴席寒。\n西南如喷酒，遥向雨中看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}